src/audio/dsound_hle.cpp follows SCDA-XBERecomp's xdk/dsound.cpp (https://github.com/TGP482/SCDA-XBERecomp;
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 TGP482, Joshhhuaaa): its sound buffers, ADPCM decoding, 3D pass, mix bins and
I3DL2 reverb. Adapted to this project: Ninja Gaiden Black's DirectSound calls and HRTF tables, SDL output, the
sound chip's HRTF filters and state variable filter as xboxrecomp/src/apu (from xemu) runs them.

